---
description: >-
  Central-connection messages (a dual circle solid arrow and a dual circle
  bidirectional arrow) interleaved with ordinary non-central messages
  (solid and cross) across three participants, checking the two message
  families coexist correctly in one flow.
config:
  look: classic
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie
  Alice ->> Bob: Normal message
  Bob ()->>() Charlie: Central connection
  Charlie -->> Alice: Normal dotted message
  Alice ()<<-->>() Bob: Dual central connection
  Bob -x Charlie: Normal cross message
